BT /F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 770 Tm (PIPS Repo - One-Page App Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 742 Tm (What it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 726 Tm (A Python analysis toolkit for coded educational video/event data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 713 Tm (It transforms source Excel files, detects temporal code patterns, and produces CSV/XLSX/plot outputs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 692 Tm (Who it is for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 676 Tm (Primary persona: education/behavior researchers or analysts working with time-coded observation data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 663 Tm (Evidence: module docstrings reference educational video coding and temporal pattern detection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 642 Tm (What it does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 626 Tm (- Transforms raw Excel code columns into normalized files under data/transformed/.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 613 Tm (- Detects temporal relationships among code families \(5.4.*, 6.1.1, 6.2.*, 5.5.*\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 600 Tm (- Extracts ordered code sequences and tags outputs \(for example PK/AK/NA\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 587 Tm (- Exports analysis artifacts \(summary, detailed, matched pairs, sequence CSV files\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 574 Tm (- Builds row-view summary tables and XLSX outputs for downstream review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 561 Tm (- Produces visual analytics scripts \(stacked charts, clustering, sunburst, transition graphs\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 540 Tm (How it works \(repo-evidence architecture\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 524 Tm (- Input: data/*.xlsx) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 511 Tm (- transform_data.py -> data/transformed/*.xlsx \(normalizes Code column\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 498 Tm (- src/detect_codes_within.py -> PatternAnalyzer orchestrates PatternDetector + SequenceAnalyzer + TimeConverter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 485 Tm (- ResultExporter writes data/transformed/analysis_results/*.csv) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 472 Tm (- src/analyse_order.py reads sequence_analysis.csv -> src/extracted_sequences.csv) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 459 Tm (- src/count_analysis.py and src/create_row_view.py consume extracted CSV for charts/tables) Tj ET
